Package: pacfishpalettes
Title: British Columbia and Pacific Region Marine Colour Palettes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(
      given = "DFO Pacific",
      family = "Contributors",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      email = "pacfishpalettes@example.org"
    )
Description: Curated colour palettes inspired by British Columbia groundfish,
    Pacific salmon, pelagics, commercial shellfish, and Pacific Region fisheries
    ecosystems, alongside taxonomic/survey sets aligned with 'gfsynopsis',
    'fishualize'-style species lookup and PhyloPic silhouettes, perceptual
    colorblindness diagnostics, and cross-package R palette metadata.
